  body
    h1 Welcome to the Web 2 Developer Bootcamp!

    p Hey #{firstName}!

    p We’re thrilled to have you join us for the Web 2 Developer Bootcamp! By signing up, you’re about to dive into the exciting world of Web Development.

    h2 What to Expect

    p Over the next few weeks, you’ll be learning directly from industry experts about essential Web development concepts—from mastering foundational principles to exploring the latest trends and tools.

    p This bootcamp is designed to build your confidence and skill set, as a Web Developer.

    h3 Join Our WhatsApp Channel!
    p #[a(href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/FuLO5uSJg9H0IcNt754GsO") Click here to join and stay updated!]

    h2 Get Ready

    p To make the most of this experience, we recommend bringing:

    ul
      li A notepad or digital document for taking notes.
      li Any previous work or projects you’d like to share or build on.
      li An open mind—be ready to collaborate, learn, and grow!

    h2 Don’t Forget

    p Add this bootcamp to your calendar! Each session will be packed with insights you won’t want to miss. And if you know friends or colleagues who’d benefit, feel free to share our registration link.

    p We’re excited to see you grow in your journey with Web Development, and we can’t wait to see the projects you’ll be working on!

    p Regards,
    p The BlockchainUNN Team
